# Frontend Patterns

## Stack
- React 18+
- TypeScript (strict mode)
- shadcn/ui for component foundation
- TanStack Query for server-state
- Minimal local UI state (only where necessary)

## Conventions
- Use functional components only.
- Use TanStack Query for all server data fetching — do not put async data in global state.
- Keep components small and focused.
- Co-locate component tests with components.
- Use SSE for real-time console updates by default; WebSocket only for bidirectional surfaces.
